      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程$5x=3x+4$只有一个根就是2。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程$(x-1)(3-x)=0$有两个根——1和3，因为等式",
        "$(1-1)(3-1)=0$和$(3-1)(3-3)=0$都是真的。这个方程",
        "再没有其他的根了。这个方程的根的集合是$\\{1,3\\}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程$2+x=x+2$有无穷多个根，因为$x$取任何值时，等",
        "式都是真的。这个方程的根的集合里包含所有的数。方程",
        "$7-x=10$没有一个根。它的根的集合是空的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "259",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "6是不是方程$36-a=24+a$的根？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "260",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "试一试用0，1，2和3代入方程$y+y=y\\cdot y$。上列各数",
        "中有没有方程的根？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "261",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程：",
        "а) $(c-111)\\cdot59=11\\,918$；",
        "б) $975\\cdot(a-459)=12\\,675$；",
        "в) $(30\\,901-b):605=51$；",
        "г) $39\\,765:(c-893)=1205$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "262",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在2，3，4，5，6各数中找出下列方程的根：",
        "$(6-x)\\cdot(x-2)=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "263",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任何数都是下列方程的根吗？",
        "а) $0\\cdot y=0$；　　　　б) $7\\cdot x=7$；",
        "в) $8\\cdot a=a\\cdot8$；　 г) $9+k-k=9$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "264",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下列方程有没有一个根？",
        "а) $x+16=12$；　　　　б) $x+12=16$；",
        "в) $x+2=4$；　　　　 г) $x\\cdot x+3=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "265",
